<section class="loreal-opening" aria-labelledby="loreal-title">
  <div class="loreal-hero">
    <picture>
      <source
        media="(max-width: 700px)"
        srcset="assets/img/loreal/loreal-104-1600.webp"
      />
      <img
        src="{{hero.src}}"
        srcset="{{hero.srcset}}"
        sizes="100vw"
        width="{{hero.width}}"
        height="{{hero.height}}"
        alt="Colour Trophy stage production with lighting and overhead screens."
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
    </picture>
    <div class="loreal-hero-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="loreal-hero-copy wrap">
      {{> shared/breadcrumb breadcrumb}}
      <span class="cue">Platinum anniversary · London &amp; Dublin</span>
      <h1 id="loreal-title">70 years of<br />L’Oréal Colour Trophy.</h1>
      <span class="loreal-hero-year">2026 / Event design &amp; production</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap loreal-intro">
    <div class="loreal-intro-bottom">
      <p>
        For the 70th anniversary of L’Oréal Colour Trophy, we developed two
        distinctive final experiences in London and Dublin. Both were linked by
        a single creative vision rooted in colour, creativity and the history of
        the competition.
      </p>
      <a class="loreal-story-link" href="#project-story">Explore the story ↓</a>
    </div>
    <nav class="loreal-chapters" aria-label="Case study chapters">
      <a href="#project-story">01 / Think</a
      ><a href="#loreal-create">02 / Create</a
      ><a href="#loreal-deliver">03 / Deliver</a
      ><a href="#loreal-gallery">04 / In pictures</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
